                            <comment id="16501971" author="githubbot" created="Tue, 5 Jun 2018 15:49:17 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;GitHub user xtern opened a pull request:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/4139&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/4139&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

